## Why This Is Asked
Assesses ability to translate CKNE scores into concrete scheduling controls for batch workloads, including start-rate shaping, resource reservations, and preemption sensitivity, plus a simple control loop and end-to-end test plan.

## Key Concepts
- CKNE-to-resource mapping
- Minute-by-minute rebalancing
- Baseline SLA guarantees
- Telemetry and fairness metrics

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example CKNE mapping
function mapCKNE(ckne, baseRate, alpha, maxCPU){
  const startRate = baseRate * (1 + alpha * ckne);
  const cpuReserve = maxCPU * ckne;
  const preempt = ckne;
  return {startRate, cpuReserve, preempt};
}
```

